{"node_id": "nd002", "text": "Need for validation", "depth": 2, "parent_id": null, "status": "confirmed", "confidence": 0.85, "confidence_raw": 0.85, "supporting_spans": [{"session_id": "p000001-cellC_dec_ungated-s1", "turn_index": 1, "quote": "I've been okay, thanks.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 23}, {"session_id": "p000001-cellC_dec_ungated-s1", "turn_index": 5, "quote": "But it feels like a burden, you know? Like everyone at the last party saw me struggling.", "char_start": 39, "char_end": 127}, {"session_id": "p000001-cellC_dec_ungated-s1", "turn_index": 7, "quote": "Thanks for listening.", "char_start": 59, "char_end": 80}, {"session_id": "p000001-cellC_dec_ungated-s1", "turn_index": 9, "quote": "Feels like everyone noticed.", "char_start": 87, "char_end": 115}, {"session_id": "p000001-cellC_dec_ungated-s1", "turn_index": 9, "quote": "I ended up drinking too much and didn't handle it well. Feels like everyone noticed.", "char_start": 31, "char_end": 115}, {"session_id": "p000001-cellC_dec_ungated-s1", "turn_index": 15, "quote": "Thanks for listening.", "char_start": 110, "char_end": 131}, {"session_id": "p000001-cellC_dec_ungated-s1", "turn_index": 19, "quote": "It's just hard when you're always worried about what others think.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 66}, {"session_id": "p000001-cellC_dec_ungated-s1", "turn_index": 19, "quote": "Thanks for being here to listen.", "char_start": 67, "char_end": 99}, {"session_id": "p000001-cellC_dec_ungated-s2", "turn_index": 1, "quote": "Not much, you know? Just trying to keep up with work and stuff.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 63}, {"session_id": "p000001-cellC_dec_ungated-s2", "turn_index": 7, "quote": "I feel like I'm not as social as I used to be.", "char_start": 57, "char_end": 103}, {"session_id": "p000001-cellC_dec_ungated-s2", "turn_index": 9, "quote": "remember that party last week? I had too much to drink and made a fool of myself.", "char_start": 69, "char_end": 150}, {"session_id": "p000001-cellC_dec_ung